OL,3,APalestinian families displaced as
OL,4,AIsraeli forces demolish Hebron homes,
OL,5,Alocal officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe operation was announced by Prime
OL,8,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu on Friday,
OL,9,Fin response to the killing of two
OL,10,FIsraeli soldiers by two Palestinian
OL,11,Fgunmen in an attack on a checkpoint.
OL,12,FThree other Israeli soldiers were
OL,13,Finjured, and the gunmen were also
OL,14,Fkilled.
OL,16,FThe Israel Defense Forces (IDF) did not
OL,17,Frespond immediately to the BBC's
OL,18,Frequest for comment. It said in a
OL,19,Fstatement on social media that it had
OL,20,Fdozens of targets across the West Bank
OL,21,Fand that its operations would last for
OL,22,Fseveral days.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
